 proud to have overcome the challenges and achieved success.\n\nNow, I'm ready for the next level! I'm looking forward to taking on a $100,000 @fxifycom challenge and inspiring others to do the same. #FXIFY #Trading #Giveaways\n\nMassive shout-out to @fxifycom for the opportunity.\n\nMassive shout-out to @XAUUSDPREACHER and @winwithbennie , without them and their charismatic X spaces and teachings , I probably wouldn't have crawled out of the dark draw-down hole I found myself in🙏🙏","original_text_sha256":"67a3b50e60c1e1b796b40967acbd3ed2f3808528c7b12d0b95e6b8804d0928d2","post_date_utc":"2024-12-03","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"payout","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"},{"topic":"profit_accounting","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"payout","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"},{"topic":"profit_accounting","ui_topic":"payout","polarity":"positive","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_reviewed","overall_review_status":"original_text_keep","source_url":"https://x.com/i/status/1863917439093756239"},"1999599547497259219":{"original_text":"FXIFY、5：50の段階で約定通らなくなるのですね……ゴールドの売りポジを決済しておこうと思ったのですが、来週に持ち越しとなりました。\n一撃即死というほどのサイズではないものの、上窓開けられたら結構痛いのですが。\nいやはや、ダメですね。","original_text_sha256":"7fd092a789e8bceb894cbbb96ec837da322107d4c9196495928bd67339b3c09a","post_date_utc":"2025-12-12","display_in_sentiment_list":true,"display_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"execution","ui_topic":"environment","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"polar_topic_proposals":[{"topic":"execution","ui_topic":"environment","polarity":"negative","claim_scope":"author_report_not_independently_verified"}],"topic_review_status":"original_text_rev